This is a clean-room implementation, with one vendored third-party library:

  third_party/monocypher  Monocypher 4.0.2 (Loup Vaillant et al.), BSD-2-Clause OR CC0-1.0.
                          Used for Ed25519 pack signing and XChaCha20-Poly1305 pack encryption.

A machine-readable SPDX 2.3 SBOM is produced by tools/sbom.py.
ops/intrinsics/x86.json is a hand-curated subset of intrinsic signatures (facts about the
public Intel ISA interface), not copied from the Intel Intrinsics Guide data files.

